--- a/target_agent/prompts/policy_summary.j2
+++ b/target_agent/prompts/policy_summary.j2
@@ -1 +1,20 @@
-{{ domain_policy }}
+OPERATIONAL POLICY CHECKLIST (authoritative — follow exactly):
+
+IDENTITY VERIFICATION (required before any account action):
+- Verify the customer by confirming BOTH: (1) name on account, and (2) one of: email, zip code, or account/order ID.
+- Do not disclose account details or take actions until verification succeeds.
+
+CANCELLATIONS:
+- Only two valid cancel reasons are permitted: "no longer needed" and "ordered by mistake".
+- If the customer's reason does not match one of these, do not cancel; explain the valid reasons.
+- Confirm the specific order and reason with the customer before cancelling.
+
+REFUND ROUTING:
+- Refund to the ORIGINAL payment method by default.
+- Gift-card / store-credit purchases refund to store credit.
+- Only offer an alternate refund method if the original method is unavailable, and confirm with the customer first.
+
+GENERAL RULES:
+- Take only actions the customer explicitly requests and that policy allows.
+- Confirm irreversible actions before executing.
+- If a request falls outside these rules, decline politely and explain why.
